ons: Get ready for the awesome experience of hand-giving a 3D gift, and watch your favorite streamers face off in intense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JSCaUK6mz4UQ7kNvwEERO0E&_nc_oc=Adm0wxBd3YMrhaX1sqfKF3UgGj4qzabfI9991jRiNFdC6vuYtwTxVVuHyjIVr62ASFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxAhaqyE5x8RGYv_yqcAxLl7cjlA1vBbGhJ561xN5DqRw&oe=69AC00DC"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X2nCddejOt0Q7kNvwETPm_Q&_nc_oc=AdkAsQs4rkBov6vGXA_AvGrl_3NfPZ8IsdryddbF-A-P7Oyrn7lxpbMNWUmv7EVtCDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxKtsgFnCXVlBtuhGNRBfY3lSqSHfL0goDIC-NYS2zjSg&oe=69AC341C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OJ9S8ITrVGgQ7kNvwEZchB_&_nc_oc=AdlJoiGPYDfFj_rzBagjXqEU19kykigJYB96qdD9s-RQvQs4TfNGgFyoGXV8o82naOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUew_hi4Y_aeQX32TUz7ES2sgE04P6OGcmrx1YTm96Cg&oe=69AC0BC5"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.